WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 21=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:49.128 --> 01:50.710
Take a look at these vegetables.

01:50.719 --> 01:51.479
Freshly picked.

01:51.480 --> 01:52.839
One coin a bunch.

01:52.840 --> 01:54.839
And look at this big pumpkin.

01:56.780 --> 01:59.300
(Sweet Taro Soup)

02:02.959 --> 02:03.958
(North Market Street)

02:03.959 --> 02:05.240
Tofu!

02:05.560 --> 02:06.839
Tofu!

02:08.039 --> 02:09.999
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

02:10.000 --> 02:11.519
(Han Ju, Han Liang's Older Sister)

02:11.520 --> 02:13.639
The vegetables here are the freshest.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.199
Tofu!

02:17.639 --> 02:19.239
Let's have a look over there.

02:19.800 --> 02:21.479
Freshly picked this morning.

02:24.319 --> 02:26.199
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

02:26.639 --> 02:28.359
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

02:29.319 --> 02:31.759
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

02:35.080 --> 02:37.120
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

02:37.880 --> 02:39.370
How much are the chrysanthemum greens?

02:39.520 --> 02:41.039
One coin for two bunches.

02:49.599 --> 02:50.638
You've got a large basket

02:50.639 --> 02:51.959
and another basket,

02:51.960 --> 02:53.519
and a child with you.

02:53.520 --> 02:55.440
Can you manage all that by yourself?

02:55.719 --> 02:57.478
My husband brought me here.

02:57.480 --> 02:58.920
He's gone to sell the game he caught.

02:59.400 --> 03:01.600
Now we have another mouth to feed,

03:02.120 --> 03:03.478
so we need to earn more.

03:03.479 --> 03:04.720
All right.

03:04.800 --> 03:06.320
I'm trying to sell things.

03:06.888 --> 03:08.150
I'll take these two bunches,

03:08.159 --> 03:09.759
and one coin's worth of cherries.

03:11.039 --> 03:12.199
Certainly.

03:24.952 --> 03:26.230
Come again if you like them.

03:26.240 --> 03:27.079
All right.

03:30.719 --> 03:32.679
Chrysanthemum greens! Cherries!

03:32.680 --> 03:33.959
Fresh chives.

03:35.039 --> 03:36.199
Two coins a bunch.

03:37.496 --> 03:39.070
Could you make them a little cheaper?

03:39.960 --> 03:40.758
Lady Han,

03:40.759 --> 03:42.359
you're Scholar Han's sister.

03:42.360 --> 03:44.759
Why haggle over a few coins
for two bunches of vegetables?

03:55.080 --> 03:56.799
A few coins are still money.

03:56.800 --> 03:57.799
What family

03:57.800 --> 03:59.438
doesn't count every coin they spend?

03:59.439 --> 04:00.718
Scholar Han's money

04:00.719 --> 04:02.079
doesn't just fall from the sky.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.639
Why shouldn't I haggle?

04:09.879 --> 04:11.720
Your chives are really fresh.

04:11.740 --> 04:12.679
I'll take two bunches.

04:12.680 --> 04:14.079
Give us a better price.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.799
They're already very cheap.

04:16.072 --> 04:18.270
The sooner you sell out,
the sooner you can pack up.

04:18.270 --> 04:20.568
If you stay out here too long,
you'll wear yourself out,

04:20.616 --> 04:22.390
and look,
the vegetables will start to wilt.

04:22.399 --> 04:24.800
Then you won't be able
to get a good price for them.

04:25.879 --> 04:26.638
All right.

04:26.639 --> 04:28.079
Three coins for two bunches.

04:30.519 --> 04:32.159
We'll buy from you again.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.000
Certainly.

04:35.560 --> 04:36.440
Here you go.

04:43.720 --> 04:46.024
No wonder my brother told me
to spend more time with you.

04:46.759 --> 04:49.480
I may not have
learned a scholar's skills,

04:49.720 --> 04:52.240
but I certainly picked up
a scholar's concern for appearances.

04:53.592 --> 04:55.032
I used to be just like you.

04:55.144 --> 04:57.030
Whenever I saw
my mother arguing with someone

04:57.040 --> 04:58.198
over a single coin,

04:58.199 --> 04:59.679
I'd feel embarrassed.

04:59.680 --> 05:00.959
You'll get used to it.

05:01.000 --> 05:02.470
When you're running a household,

05:02.480 --> 05:03.919
every coin you save

05:03.920 --> 05:05.120
adds up.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.719
I've learned my lesson.

05:07.879 --> 05:10.000
Kind words cost nothing,
so say as many as you like.

05:10.072 --> 05:11.150
But when it comes to money,

05:11.160 --> 05:12.719
not a single coin more.

05:27.464 --> 05:28.560
What are you looking at?

05:28.584 --> 05:29.288
That's the house.

05:29.310 --> 05:30.159
Knock on the door.

05:30.160 --> 05:31.000
All right.

05:31.079 --> 05:31.599
Go!

05:31.600 --> 05:34.239
- Open up!
- Open up!

05:34.240 --> 05:35.318
Come out!

05:35.319 --> 05:36.958
Han is our thirteenth brother's wife.

05:36.959 --> 05:38.438
She must remain a widow for him.

05:38.440 --> 05:39.490
- That's right!
- Exactly!

05:39.500 --> 05:41.318
Her husband is dead.
She must remain a widow!

05:41.319 --> 05:42.440
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

05:42.639 --> 05:43.479
Open up!

05:43.480 --> 05:45.159
She must remain a widow! Open up!

05:47.360 --> 05:47.958
Open up!

05:47.959 --> 05:49.159
- Open up!
- Open the door!

05:49.160 --> 05:49.799
Open up!

05:49.800 --> 05:50.838
Hand her over!

05:50.839 --> 05:51.559
Open up!

05:51.560 --> 05:52.039
Open up!

05:52.040 --> 05:53.039
(Clan Leader Zhang)
Hand her over! Come out!

05:53.040 --> 05:53.799
Come out!

05:53.800 --> 05:55.078
Open up!

05:55.079 --> 05:55.758
Come out!

05:55.759 --> 05:56.359
Open up!

05:56.360 --> 05:57.399
Open up!

06:08.079 --> 06:09.480
You've all come a long way.

06:09.920 --> 06:10.880
I apologize

06:11.959 --> 06:13.279
for not being here to welcome you.

06:17.040 --> 06:18.320
Scholar Han,

06:18.720 --> 06:20.239
you brought your sister home

06:20.240 --> 06:22.278
without our Zhang family's consent,

06:22.279 --> 06:24.519
and you still haven't sent
her back after all this time.

06:24.920 --> 06:26.800
Just what are you trying to do?

06:26.872 --> 06:28.360
After the way you treated my daughter,

06:28.370 --> 06:31.120
(Feng Lin, Han Liang's Mother)
you have the nerve to demand her back?

06:36.480 --> 06:37.599
Sir,

06:38.240 --> 06:39.680
my brother-in-law was an only son.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.839
His parents passed away long ago.

06:42.056 --> 06:42.968
Now my sister

06:42.980 --> 06:45.150
has no parents-in-law above her
and no children below,

06:45.160 --> 06:47.096
nor any of her husband's
brothers or their wives.

06:47.240 --> 06:48.959
What is wrong

06:49.279 --> 06:50.800
with bringing her back home?

06:51.240 --> 06:53.112
The late Emperor made it clear long ago

06:53.120 --> 06:55.470
that a woman should remain
faithful to one husband for life

06:55.480 --> 06:57.000
and never remarry.

06:57.040 --> 06:59.720
Your sister is already
a wife of the Zhang family.

06:59.816 --> 07:01.870
Then she should remain
a widow for her late husband.

07:01.879 --> 07:02.518
- Yes.
- Yes.

07:02.519 --> 07:03.920
The late Emperor also said

07:04.136 --> 07:06.710
that remaining a widow must be voluntary
and cannot be forced.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.120
Under the laws of our dynasty,

07:08.168 --> 07:09.430
when a woman's husband dies

07:09.439 --> 07:11.040
and she has no surviving parents-in-law,

07:11.079 --> 07:13.040
her own parents may decide for her.

07:14.560 --> 07:16.759
I will not allow
my daughter to remain a widow.

07:17.199 --> 07:18.078
Your son

07:18.079 --> 07:20.159
is going to become an official someday.

07:20.160 --> 07:21.976
His reputation matters above all.

07:22.040 --> 07:25.000
Having a sister known for her
unwavering fidelity to her late husband

07:25.279 --> 07:28.639
would also benefit him.

07:28.759 --> 07:30.360
That's right.

07:34.120 --> 07:36.480
I had no choice.

07:40.319 --> 07:42.000
Sister!

07:48.720 --> 07:49.839
Sir,

07:50.879 --> 07:52.279
I beg to differ.

07:53.759 --> 07:54.719
Becoming an official

07:55.600 --> 07:57.519
depends on genuine
ability and hard work.

07:58.472 --> 08:00.390
If, for the sake
of becoming an official,

08:00.959 --> 08:02.839
a man would
sacrifice his own sister's life,

08:03.560 --> 08:04.599
then such a man

08:05.439 --> 08:06.800
is lower than an animal.

08:07.959 --> 08:09.680
He isn't even worthy
of being called a man,

08:13.000 --> 08:14.599
let alone an official.

08:14.600 --> 08:15.440
You...

08:15.519 --> 08:17.199
Well said!

08:17.959 --> 08:20.599
That deserves a hearty toast.

08:21.399 --> 08:22.559
Who is this man?

08:22.560 --> 08:24.000
This is none of his business.

08:29.079 --> 08:30.159
Your sister

08:30.160 --> 08:31.958
was formally married
into our Zhang family

08:31.959 --> 08:33.520
with all the proper rites.

08:34.120 --> 08:35.870
In life, she belongs
to the Zhang family.

08:35.879 --> 08:37.678
In death, she belongs
to the Zhang family.

08:37.679 --> 08:38.839
She must remain a widow.

08:38.840 --> 08:39.479
Hand her over!

08:39.480 --> 08:39.839
Yes!

08:39.840 --> 08:41.040
She must remain a widow!

08:41.200 --> 08:42.119
Hand her over!

08:42.120 --> 08:44.959
- Hand her over!
- Hand her over!

08:44.960 --> 08:46.239
Hand her over!

08:46.240 --> 08:47.439
Don't resort to violence!

08:47.440 --> 08:49.199
We can talk this through.
Don't hit people!

08:49.200 --> 08:50.319
Hand her over!

08:50.320 --> 08:51.079
Hand her over!

08:51.080 --> 08:52.079
- Hand her over!
- Right!

08:52.080 --> 08:53.319
Even if I die,

08:53.320 --> 08:55.398
I won't hand over my daughter.

08:55.400 --> 08:57.960
If you want to take my daughter today,

08:58.008 --> 08:59.990
you'll have to step over
my dead body first.

09:00.000 --> 09:00.719
Hand her over!

09:00.720 --> 09:01.680
Mother!

09:01.799 --> 09:02.879
Mother!

09:03.759 --> 09:05.119
Don't hit anyone!

09:07.320 --> 09:08.079
Sister!

09:08.080 --> 09:08.918
Don't go out there.

09:08.920 --> 09:10.920
If you go out now,
you'll only make things worse.

09:10.984 --> 09:12.280
Someone could even end up dead.

09:17.000 --> 09:17.719
Grandpa Tu,

09:17.720 --> 09:18.798
keep an eye on her.

09:18.799 --> 09:19.500
All right.

09:21.279 --> 09:22.440
My tung oil!

09:23.879 --> 09:24.959
Move aside!

09:24.960 --> 09:26.038
Hand her over!

09:26.039 --> 09:27.719
- Hand her over!
- Hand her over!

09:27.720 --> 09:29.239
Hand her over!

09:31.120 --> 09:32.079
Hand her over!

09:33.960 --> 09:34.920
Hand her over!

09:57.559 --> 09:58.839
Who did this?

10:01.519 --> 10:02.440
The tung oil!

10:02.519 --> 10:03.599
Tung oil?

10:05.039 --> 10:06.239
Who did this?

10:06.240 --> 10:07.359
Who did it?

10:09.600 --> 10:10.999
Help me up.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.280
Who spilled the tung oil?

10:18.440 --> 10:19.560
Who did it?

10:19.570 --> 10:20.792
Under the laws of our dynasty,

10:20.800 --> 10:22.750
forcing one's way
into a home to seize someone

10:22.759 --> 10:25.680
is punishable by one year
in prison and eighty strokes.

10:27.120 --> 10:28.479
Eighty strokes, huh?

10:33.272 --> 10:35.280
Striking someone
with one's hands or feet

10:35.304 --> 10:37.496
without causing injury
is punishable by twenty strokes.

10:37.500 --> 10:39.660
If injury is caused,
the punishment is thirty strokes.

10:39.759 --> 10:41.400
Bruising or swelling
counts as an injury.

10:42.559 --> 10:44.040
Striking someone with an object

10:44.120 --> 10:46.290
without causing injury
is punishable by thirty strokes.

10:46.300 --> 10:48.408
If injury is caused,
the punishment is forty strokes.

10:49.720 --> 10:51.278
I'm reporting this to the authorities!

10:51.279 --> 10:52.798
I'll tell them someone

10:52.799 --> 10:55.079
gathered a mob to assault Scholar Han.

10:55.080 --> 10:56.520
Just you wait.

10:58.480 --> 11:00.760
Children, come with me
to report them. Let's go!

11:00.840 --> 11:02.959
Insulting and assaulting
an imperial student

11:03.519 --> 11:04.920
carries an even heavier penalty.

11:12.879 --> 11:14.760
Are you demanding
that my sister remain a widow

11:15.159 --> 11:17.440
out of respect
for propriety and righteousness,

11:18.120 --> 11:20.079
or so that your Zhang clan

11:20.080 --> 11:22.680
can pay less grain tax
and be exempt from compulsory labor?

11:24.960 --> 11:26.119
My sister

11:26.879 --> 11:28.280
respects propriety and righteousness

11:28.728 --> 11:30.870
and is willing to remain
a widow for her late husband.

11:31.120 --> 11:33.239
But even
the lowliest creatures cling to life.

11:34.559 --> 11:35.680
Besides,

11:37.752 --> 11:40.560
my sister still has an aging mother
and a younger brother to care for.

11:40.648 --> 11:43.470
If she ignored the love that raised her
and the bond between siblings

11:43.480 --> 11:44.999
and simply ended her life,

11:45.000 --> 11:47.040
wouldn't that
be both unfilial and unjust?

11:48.360 --> 11:50.079
For the sake
of a chastity memorial arch,

11:50.080 --> 11:52.072
you locked my sister in a small room,

11:52.296 --> 11:53.550
subjected her to cruel remarks,

11:53.550 --> 11:56.344
deprived her of food and clothing,
and drove her to take her own life.

11:57.879 --> 11:59.800
If I hadn't gone to see my sister,

12:00.808 --> 12:02.950
I'm afraid you would
have gotten your wish long ago,

12:02.960 --> 12:04.984
and she would have died
to preserve her chastity!

12:09.759 --> 12:10.959
Mister Lu,

12:10.960 --> 12:12.239
you were a Third Place Scholar

12:12.240 --> 12:14.380
and know better than anyone
how the authorities work.

12:14.392 --> 12:16.310
Tell me, if a widow
is driven to her death

12:16.320 --> 12:18.040
just to obtain a chastity memorial arch,

12:18.320 --> 12:20.758
will the authorities exempt
the clan from compulsory labor

12:20.759 --> 12:22.400
and reduce its grain tax?

12:23.879 --> 12:25.079
No.

12:26.720 --> 12:30.119
When it comes to such greed,

12:30.120 --> 12:32.800
and such disregard
for basic human decency,

12:33.440 --> 12:35.239
once the authorities find out,

12:35.240 --> 12:38.160
they will not only revoke
the chastity memorial arch,

12:38.879 --> 12:42.239
but also severely
punish the clan leader,

12:42.639 --> 12:46.359
and may even implicate the entire clan.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.479
This...

12:47.480 --> 12:48.440
Clan Leader!

12:49.000 --> 12:52.792
The Central City Patrol Office is here!

12:52.856 --> 12:53.790
The City Patrol Office?

12:53.799 --> 12:54.599
Go! Run!

12:54.600 --> 12:55.440
Run!

13:00.080 --> 13:02.800
The Central City Patrol Office is here!

13:07.840 --> 13:08.959
Mother!

13:10.480 --> 13:11.479
My daughter!

13:11.799 --> 13:12.920
My daughter!

13:14.240 --> 13:15.079
Don't be afraid.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.119
My daughter,

13:16.720 --> 13:18.520
the Zhang family is gone.

13:19.080 --> 13:20.439
I'm here.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.440
Don't be afraid.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.839
The Zhang family is gone.

13:25.840 --> 13:27.359
Don't be afraid.

13:27.799 --> 13:29.239
I'm here.

13:40.320 --> 13:42.319
Your tung oil saved the day.

13:42.320 --> 13:44.296
We'll have something
extra for dinner tonight.

13:46.240 --> 13:47.239
Grandpa Tu,

13:47.240 --> 13:48.878
I'll buy another jar of tung oil later

13:48.879 --> 13:49.959
to replace yours.

13:50.039 --> 13:51.199
I still have more.

13:51.519 --> 13:53.320
I should pay for it.

13:55.399 --> 13:57.040
I'll buy you some small fish, too.

13:57.360 --> 13:58.638
We'll fry them for dinner.

13:58.639 --> 14:01.040
- Thank you, Scholar Han.
- Thank you, Scholar Han.

14:01.360 --> 14:02.199
All right.

14:02.200 --> 14:03.359
It's all right now.

14:03.360 --> 14:04.319
- Let's clear out.
- Let's clear out.

14:04.320 --> 14:06.640
Everyone, you can go home now.
- Let's go.

14:12.080 --> 14:14.160
We couldn't have gotten
through today without you.

14:14.480 --> 14:16.359
If Lanxiang hadn't been so quick-witted,

14:16.360 --> 14:19.119
the two of us
would have been outnumbered,

14:19.120 --> 14:21.719
and I'm afraid we couldn't
have protected my daughter.

14:21.720 --> 14:22.678
It's all right.

14:22.679 --> 14:24.160
Thank you.

14:24.240 --> 14:25.368
Auntie, don't you always say

14:25.370 --> 14:27.430
a close neighbor
is better than a distant relative?

14:27.440 --> 14:29.239
When our family first moved here,

14:29.240 --> 14:31.520
you and Scholar Han
helped us a great deal.

14:31.799 --> 14:34.119
Besides, I didn't
really do much just now.

14:34.320 --> 14:36.558
I only backed Scholar Han up

14:36.559 --> 14:38.040
and helped scare them off.

14:39.480 --> 14:41.999
It's all thanks to Lanxiang's
thorough knowledge of the law.

14:42.279 --> 14:43.760
Without lifting a finger,

14:44.120 --> 14:47.239
you saved
our family from a terrible ordeal.

14:48.919 --> 14:50.520
You're too kind, Scholar Han.

14:50.559 --> 14:53.719
I was merely showing off
what little I know before an expert.

14:53.720 --> 14:55.096
I hope I didn't embarrass myself.

14:57.940 --> 15:00.139
♪I can't forget♪

15:00.140 --> 15:01.859
♪My longing fills my eyes♪

15:01.860 --> 15:05.099
♪My longing lingers
like the fragrance of orchids♪

15:05.100 --> 15:09.100
♪I've walked through
frost-covered streets far and wide♪

15:09.820 --> 15:13.100
♪I'm blessed to have you
understand my tender heart♪

15:18.159 --> 15:20.879
What do you think of
Scholar Han next door?

15:23.000 --> 15:25.959
Lanxiang only
taught me a few characters.

15:25.960 --> 15:28.160
How would I know what he's like?

15:29.200 --> 15:33.839
But Mister Lu thinks highly of him,

15:34.080 --> 15:37.160
so I imagine he's quite learned.

15:37.200 --> 15:40.239
Who said anything about his learning?

15:42.080 --> 15:43.160
His looks?

15:43.440 --> 15:44.760
He's quite good-looking.

15:44.879 --> 15:47.199
More handsome than I was at his age.

15:47.879 --> 15:49.239
You don't give our daughter's

15:49.240 --> 15:51.520
future any thought at all, do you?

15:56.279 --> 15:57.640
You mean

15:59.519 --> 16:00.839
Lanxiang

16:01.399 --> 16:02.999
and Scholar Han?

16:07.000 --> 16:08.199
I've been thinking

16:08.200 --> 16:10.320
Lanxiang isn't getting any younger.

16:10.559 --> 16:12.599
If we keep putting this off,

16:12.639 --> 16:14.719
she may end up never marrying.

16:16.960 --> 16:18.839
We know

16:18.840 --> 16:20.999
how wonderful she is,

16:21.000 --> 16:22.760
but when it comes
to finding her a match,

16:23.120 --> 16:25.079
the two families
still need to be well matched.

16:26.159 --> 16:27.959
Our humble backgrounds

16:29.559 --> 16:31.040
have put her at a disadvantage.

16:31.320 --> 16:34.520
Fortunately, there's
a family like Scholar Han's.

16:37.120 --> 16:39.839
I've always thought highly of him.

16:40.440 --> 16:42.359
And after what happened today,

16:42.440 --> 16:44.839
he'd rather sacrifice his own reputation

16:44.960 --> 16:46.999
than fail to protect his sister.

16:47.480 --> 16:50.959
Madam Han is also kind and honorable.

16:51.016 --> 16:52.550
If she became Lanxiang's mother-in-law,

16:52.559 --> 16:55.959
I'm sure she'd treat
her daughter-in-law well.

17:00.440 --> 17:02.920
There's no use getting
so excited about it ourselves.

17:03.279 --> 17:05.320
We don't know
what the Han family thinks.

17:06.920 --> 17:08.359
I think Madam Han

17:09.000 --> 17:10.439
feels the same way I do.

17:10.440 --> 17:11.599
Really?

17:11.759 --> 17:15.399
I don't think Madam Han
is the only one fond of Lanxiang.

17:15.599 --> 17:17.079
I'm afraid Scholar Han

17:17.240 --> 17:18.280
has long...

17:19.440 --> 17:21.439
That young man...

17:21.960 --> 17:24.200
No wonder he's been so attentive.

17:24.279 --> 17:26.679
So he had an ulterior motive all along.

17:26.680 --> 17:27.760
He didn't...

17:28.839 --> 17:29.919
Who knows? Someday

17:29.920 --> 17:32.079
he may really become our son-in-law.

17:32.319 --> 17:33.720
Nonsense.

17:36.720 --> 17:40.079
Lanxiang and Scholar Han

17:40.400 --> 17:41.520
would make a good match.

17:52.640 --> 17:53.800
They're here!

17:54.180 --> 17:59.099
(A Joyous Betrothal
Between the Yuan and Lin Families)

17:59.100 --> 18:03.900
(Glorify the Family Name)

18:17.976 --> 18:19.960
It's only the presentation
of betrothal gifts.

18:20.072 --> 18:22.150
Did they have to make
such a grand affair of it?

18:22.200 --> 18:24.730
Anyone who didn't know better
would think the wedding was today.

18:30.799 --> 18:32.200
That Xiuru is getting carried

18:32.280 --> 18:34.560
(Lin Residence, Huaqiong Courtyard)
away with herself.

18:34.880 --> 18:36.960
She's become unbearably conceited.

18:58.460 --> 19:03.740
(Miscellaneous Records of Yuefu
The Romance of Poetry)

19:03.759 --> 19:05.999
My son has followed the ancient rites

19:06.000 --> 19:07.558
and bestowed generous gifts upon us.

19:07.559 --> 19:09.278
I dare not decline them.

19:09.279 --> 19:11.280
I gladly accept.

19:16.740 --> 19:20.140
(By request of Shide)

19:20.300 --> 19:23.620
(Lin Residence, Yujiao Garden)

19:26.079 --> 19:27.879
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

19:27.920 --> 19:28.970
The Yuan and Lin families

19:28.980 --> 19:30.118
are truly well matched.

19:30.119 --> 19:31.479
Congratulations, Xiuru.

19:31.480 --> 19:32.479
The Yuan and Lin families

19:32.480 --> 19:34.079
have completed the betrothal ceremony.

19:35.400 --> 19:37.078
They truly are a perfect match.

19:37.080 --> 19:38.392
What a wonderful marriage.

19:38.400 --> 19:40.392
The Yuan family
made even the betrothal ceremony

19:40.408 --> 19:41.760
such a grand occasion.

19:41.799 --> 19:44.240
The wedding will surely be even grander.

19:46.759 --> 19:49.078
Xiuru now has

19:49.079 --> 19:50.839
the best match among us.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.040
Xiuwan,

20:17.480 --> 20:19.399
if you're upset,

20:19.640 --> 20:21.679
talk to me about it.

20:23.440 --> 20:25.119
You're worrying too much, Mother.

20:25.759 --> 20:28.798
Grandfather said Xiuru's good marriage

20:28.799 --> 20:30.839
will benefit the entire Lin family.

20:31.720 --> 20:33.439
As a member of the Lin family,

20:34.079 --> 20:35.560
I'll naturally benefit as well.

20:41.519 --> 20:43.879
My poor child.

20:54.559 --> 20:57.000
I know how much you're hurting inside.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.119
Just look at Xiuru.

21:03.279 --> 21:05.839
In both background and looks,

21:05.880 --> 21:08.359
she falls short of you in every way.

21:08.599 --> 21:10.320
But look at her now.

21:11.680 --> 21:12.599
She...

21:14.160 --> 21:15.560
Mother.

21:17.759 --> 21:19.240
Everything in this world

21:19.480 --> 21:21.760
has its cause and its consequence.

21:22.799 --> 21:24.919
The consequences I face today

21:25.200 --> 21:27.599
were brought about
by my own past actions.

21:28.559 --> 21:30.240
Xiuru had nothing to do with it.

21:37.640 --> 21:39.359
It's all Du Cuique's fault,

21:39.960 --> 21:41.760
and Du Zheng's, too.

21:42.119 --> 21:45.000
Those two are utterly heartless.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.399
Xiuwan,

21:52.759 --> 21:54.639
I shouldn't have said that.

21:54.839 --> 21:56.758
I shouldn't have said that.

21:56.759 --> 21:58.358
I won't mention it again.

21:58.359 --> 21:59.919
Never again.

22:03.400 --> 22:05.359
After Grandfather
confined me to the house,

22:06.039 --> 22:08.280
Jinqi sent me many books

22:08.680 --> 22:10.399
and told me to read more,

22:10.599 --> 22:13.439
to look higher and farther,

22:13.440 --> 22:15.359
and see the world beyond this courtyard.

22:18.279 --> 22:19.800
Jinqi said

22:20.759 --> 22:23.119
there's no turning back in life.

22:24.200 --> 22:26.359
Since I made a terrible mistake,

22:27.240 --> 22:28.399
for the rest of my life,

22:29.200 --> 22:32.079
I'll have to carry
the burden of Du Zheng.

22:32.240 --> 22:34.278
Jinqi was talking nonsense.

22:34.279 --> 22:36.078
You mustn't take it to heart,

22:36.079 --> 22:37.320
understand?

22:37.400 --> 22:38.760
Jinqi said

22:39.119 --> 22:42.399
life is like sailing down a river.

22:42.480 --> 22:44.919
No one can
have calm waters all their life.

22:46.119 --> 22:47.760
If I'm a small boat,

22:48.400 --> 22:49.358
then sooner or later,

22:49.359 --> 22:51.439
the weight of Du Zheng will sink me.

22:52.480 --> 22:53.599
But

22:54.119 --> 22:55.639
if I'm a great ship,

22:56.279 --> 22:58.760
the larger the ship,
the smaller the stone becomes.

22:59.720 --> 23:02.520
As long as I can
make my ship large enough,

23:03.359 --> 23:04.560
one day,

23:05.279 --> 23:07.960
even if someone points
that stone out to me,

23:08.359 --> 23:10.679
it will be nothing
more than a tiny stone.

23:15.839 --> 23:16.839
Mother,

23:19.200 --> 23:20.839
I want to try

23:21.960 --> 23:24.480
to become the great ship Jinqi spoke of.

23:30.359 --> 23:31.439
All right.

23:32.079 --> 23:33.159
All right.

23:33.880 --> 23:36.000
Whether you want to become a great ship

23:36.960 --> 23:38.720
or build yourself a grand house,

23:40.559 --> 23:42.119
I'll help you.

23:50.200 --> 23:52.359
Don't resent Xiuru anymore.

23:53.240 --> 23:55.599
I may not become the Marchioness,

23:55.640 --> 23:57.599
but I'll become the Marquis's sister.

23:58.359 --> 24:00.358
When they see me in the future,

24:00.359 --> 24:02.800
they'll both have
to greet me properly as family.

24:04.039 --> 24:05.800
You silly girl.

24:10.839 --> 24:11.800
All right.

24:11.839 --> 24:12.800
All right.

24:14.279 --> 24:15.839
Whatever you say.

24:37.519 --> 24:38.558
Xiuru

24:38.559 --> 24:41.598
isn't your own daughter, after all.

24:41.600 --> 24:44.520
I'd say it's enough as long as
you observe the proper courtesies.

24:45.519 --> 24:47.159
The most pressing matter now

24:47.160 --> 24:49.159
is Young Master's marriage.

24:49.288 --> 24:51.070
Before, we had to consider
the Zhao family,

24:51.079 --> 24:52.679
so we couldn't look for a match.

24:52.680 --> 24:53.558
But now Zhao

24:53.559 --> 24:55.719
has been married off
to the capital for almost a year.

24:55.720 --> 24:57.919
You should start making careful plans

24:57.920 --> 24:59.760
for Young Master's marriage.

25:00.880 --> 25:03.000
You're even more anxious than I am.

25:03.624 --> 25:04.910
I've already asked a matchmaker

25:04.920 --> 25:07.000
to find Jiugao a wife.

25:07.200 --> 25:08.838
Young Master is

25:08.839 --> 25:10.760
several years older than Jiugao.

25:13.559 --> 25:14.879
It may not be pleasant to hear,

25:15.599 --> 25:17.399
but it's the plain truth.

25:21.960 --> 25:24.320
Jinqi is my only son.

25:24.799 --> 25:27.760
How could I not plan carefully for him?

25:28.440 --> 25:30.318
I think about it every day.

25:30.319 --> 25:32.159
So you already have someone in mind?

25:33.200 --> 25:34.599
Is there a suitable candidate?

25:39.559 --> 25:41.480
Duke Xianguo's youngest daughter.

25:48.599 --> 25:50.159
Now I remember.

25:50.279 --> 25:53.919
Duke Xianguo had a daughter
late in life after remarrying.

25:54.640 --> 25:57.599
I hear she's intelligent and gentle

25:57.920 --> 25:59.838
and has won
Dowager Consort Zheng's favor.

25:59.839 --> 26:01.639
She's been raised
in the palace ever since.

26:02.319 --> 26:03.639
Good heavens!

26:03.640 --> 26:04.952
The youngest daughter of a duke,

26:04.984 --> 26:06.910
raised by a dowager consort no less.

26:07.000 --> 26:08.919
No wonder you weren't in any hurry.

26:10.640 --> 26:13.200
Dowager Consort Zheng
and Old Madam go way back.

26:13.839 --> 26:16.760
The older people get,
the more they cherish old ties.

26:17.279 --> 26:19.599
They often exchange letters.

26:20.240 --> 26:21.518
I suppose

26:21.519 --> 26:23.919
she heard about Old Madam's troubles,

26:24.279 --> 26:25.359
and as it happens,

26:25.400 --> 26:27.838
Young Lady Zheng
has reached marriageable age,

26:27.839 --> 26:30.278
so she thought she'd play matchmaker

26:30.279 --> 26:32.040
and bring about a good match.

26:32.640 --> 26:33.959
She's already sent people

26:33.960 --> 26:35.960
to escort Young Lady Zheng
back to Jinling.

26:36.599 --> 26:38.999
So this is the match
that's been waiting for Young Master.

26:39.000 --> 26:42.038
Good things really are worth the wait.

26:42.039 --> 26:44.079
A fine man never
has to worry about finding a wife.

26:44.759 --> 26:46.280
When it comes to his marriage,

26:47.119 --> 26:49.679
I've always felt I let Jinqi down.

26:50.599 --> 26:51.639
Now,

26:51.839 --> 26:54.520
I've finally found him a young lady
from a distinguished family

26:54.960 --> 26:56.800
who is also learned and courteous.

26:58.720 --> 27:01.839
Young Master will surely be delighted.

27:17.279 --> 27:19.278
Playing the Child.

27:19.279 --> 27:20.639
One theory says

27:20.640 --> 27:23.318
it came from a Sanskrit street cry

27:23.319 --> 27:25.318
heard in the markets
of the Song dynasty,

27:25.319 --> 27:27.159
"Mohouluo."

27:27.359 --> 27:28.679
Another theory says

27:28.680 --> 27:32.758
it came from a sung entertainment
in Song dynasty theaters.

27:32.760 --> 27:34.520
The name
has been used for a Daoist ballad,

27:34.530 --> 27:35.990
a precious scroll tune, a melody,

27:36.000 --> 27:38.760
a lyric pattern, and a folk tune.

27:38.839 --> 27:41.518
It existed as early
as the Tang and Song dynasties.

27:41.519 --> 27:42.518
Today,

27:42.519 --> 27:45.560
the earliest surviving
Playing the Child...

27:54.680 --> 27:55.800
Young Master.

27:57.359 --> 27:59.240
Lanxiang isn't home.

28:03.119 --> 28:07.280
She's working at Mister Lu's,
transcribing songs and lyrics.

28:08.200 --> 28:09.078
Perfect.

28:09.079 --> 28:10.800
I'll pay Mister Lu a visit.

28:15.680 --> 28:17.399
Scholar Han is also...

28:17.519 --> 28:19.159
Also at Mister Lu's.

28:21.576 --> 28:22.950
He went there to borrow some books.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.240
He only left a short while ago.

28:38.039 --> 28:39.639
Young Master has distinguished bearing

28:39.640 --> 28:40.936
and remarkable courage and valor.

28:46.470 --> 28:47.976
Go back and copy
"Appearance" from A New Account

28:47.980 --> 28:49.390
of the Tales of the World ten times.

28:49.680 --> 28:51.399
Learn how to flatter someone properly.

28:59.519 --> 29:04.838
♪Quickly order Guan Ping
to light the lamp♪

29:04.839 --> 29:12.879
♪Let's discuss the Zuo Commentary
from the beginning♪

29:12.880 --> 29:23.439
♪The rise and fall of dynasties
after the former emperors♪

29:23.440 --> 29:38.000
♪How many emperors were wise,
and how many were foolish?♪

29:39.519 --> 29:48.959
♪The Zuo Commentary♪

29:48.960 --> 30:02.679
♪Let's discuss the Zuo Commentary
from the beginning♪

30:02.680 --> 30:09.959
♪The rise and fall of dynasties
after the former emperors♪

30:09.960 --> 30:21.720
♪How many emperors were wise,
and how many were foolish?♪

30:29.599 --> 30:30.399
Good.

30:34.119 --> 30:35.159
Young Master.

30:36.480 --> 30:38.000
Young Master, what brings you here?

30:43.519 --> 30:44.879
My surname is Lin,

30:44.880 --> 30:46.078
given name Jinqi,

30:46.079 --> 30:47.280
courtesy name Fengtai.

30:47.384 --> 30:48.824
Forgive me for calling unannounced.

30:48.830 --> 30:50.490
When I heard
such a wonderful performance,

30:50.500 --> 30:52.159
I couldn't help applauding and cheering.

30:52.240 --> 30:54.000
I'm sorry to have

30:54.160 --> 30:55.439
disturbed you, Sir.

30:58.839 --> 31:00.720
Your grandfather

31:00.839 --> 31:03.079
is Lin Zhaoxiang?

31:09.279 --> 31:13.320
We follow different paths
and have nothing to say to each other.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.679
It's just a small gift.

31:34.839 --> 31:36.000
Please accept it.

31:46.960 --> 31:48.278
Mister Lu is drunk.

31:48.279 --> 31:49.159
When he sobers up,

31:49.160 --> 31:50.424
I'll tell him about your visit.

31:51.400 --> 31:52.159
Young Master,

31:52.160 --> 31:53.464
come sit at my house for a while.

31:54.160 --> 31:55.040
All right.

31:55.680 --> 31:56.760
I'll see you over.

32:00.400 --> 32:01.598
Grandpa Tu,

32:01.599 --> 32:03.439
we left the gifts on the table.

32:05.440 --> 32:06.159
This way.

32:15.368 --> 32:17.110
I heard you were promoted, Young Master.

32:17.110 --> 32:18.344
Mother and I made some pastries,

32:18.350 --> 32:20.000
and Father brought them
to your residence.

32:20.056 --> 32:21.280
Congratulations, Young Master.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.439
Congratulations, Commander Lin.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.079
This door...

32:28.440 --> 32:29.480
You don't close it?

32:30.039 --> 32:31.358
Not during the day.

32:31.359 --> 32:33.798
I need to study the songs
and transcribe them,

32:33.799 --> 32:35.320
so I'm constantly coming and going.

32:35.880 --> 32:36.919
Mister Lu and Grandpa Tu

32:36.920 --> 32:38.679
both enjoy my mother's cooking.

32:38.680 --> 32:41.679
Mother also says
it's easier to cook for more people,

32:41.680 --> 32:43.200
so we all eat together every day.

32:44.039 --> 32:45.240
This way, Young Master.

32:46.808 --> 32:48.630
My mother went to Scholar Han's house

32:48.640 --> 32:50.919
to do needlework with Madam Han.

32:50.960 --> 32:52.599
My father is at the shop out front.

32:56.559 --> 32:57.118
Young Master,

32:57.119 --> 32:57.919
have a seat.

32:58.119 --> 32:59.280
I'll make some tea.

33:19.559 --> 33:22.159
Do you study entirely
on your own, Scholar Han,

33:22.319 --> 33:23.800
without a teacher to guide you?

33:23.920 --> 33:25.558
When Mister Lu is in a good mood,

33:25.559 --> 33:27.040
he'll offer me some guidance.

33:28.359 --> 33:30.119
Mister Lu is immensely learned,

33:30.200 --> 33:31.679
but for the provincial examination,

33:31.720 --> 33:33.832
you still need
to review every subject thoroughly.

33:35.920 --> 33:38.359
I was once a student of Scholar Shouyi.

33:38.640 --> 33:40.038
If you're willing,

33:40.039 --> 33:41.919
I can recommend you to Qixia Academy

33:41.920 --> 33:43.639
to study under Scholar Shouyi.

33:44.960 --> 33:46.479
I've long heard of Scholar Shouyi's

33:46.480 --> 33:47.598
great reputation.

33:47.599 --> 33:49.439
To have the chance
to study at Qixia Academy

33:49.440 --> 33:50.879
would be an honor for me.

33:54.319 --> 33:56.800
Scholar Han is going
to study at Qixia Academy?

34:10.480 --> 34:11.479
It's just that

34:11.840 --> 34:13.320
my circumstances are unusual,

34:13.760 --> 34:15.080
and I have other plans.

34:15.119 --> 34:16.800
I can only appreciate

34:17.199 --> 34:18.919
your kind offer, Commander Lin.

34:43.079 --> 34:45.160
Young Master,
are you here to see my father?

34:47.920 --> 34:50.439
Yesterday was Xiuru's
betrothal ceremony.

34:50.472 --> 34:52.760
First Madam asked me
to bring over two boxes of pastries

34:52.824 --> 34:54.320
so you could share in the joy.

34:54.679 --> 34:55.959
Thank you, Young Master.

34:57.280 --> 34:58.479
There's something else.

34:58.760 --> 34:59.879
Yuchan and Gantang

34:59.880 --> 35:01.439
asked me to bring this to you.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.399
What is it?

35:22.760 --> 35:23.879
An orchid?

35:24.519 --> 35:26.680
Why would they specially
send me a potted orchid?

35:30.639 --> 35:32.200
(What flower is that fragrance from?)

35:32.519 --> 35:33.839
(An orchid.)

35:34.880 --> 35:37.720
Some orchids are most fragrant at noon,

35:38.239 --> 35:41.120
while others are most fragrant at night.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.399
It smells wonderful.

35:46.040 --> 35:48.390
Didn't you say it blooms
at night and smells wonderful?

35:48.840 --> 35:50.120
I happened to divide the plant,

35:50.719 --> 35:51.999
so I brought you

35:52.070 --> 35:53.224
one of the new shoots.

35:58.920 --> 36:00.638
Thanks to Yuchan and Gantang.

36:00.640 --> 36:02.664
They even remembered
to bring me a potted flower.

36:13.920 --> 36:14.839
I should

36:15.599 --> 36:16.999
get back to my studies.

36:21.199 --> 36:22.600
I should be going, too.

36:23.032 --> 36:24.870
You both
have important matters to attend to,

36:24.880 --> 36:26.399
so I won't keep you.

36:26.519 --> 36:27.680
Take care, Young Master.

36:28.000 --> 36:29.280
Take care, Scholar Han.

37:54.760 --> 37:57.160
Why won't you go study at Qixia Academy?

37:58.039 --> 38:00.800
Scholar Shouyi
is a renowned scholar of our time.

38:01.400 --> 38:03.598
You clearly seemed interested.

38:03.599 --> 38:05.959
Why did you turn down
Young Master Lin's kind offer?

38:11.624 --> 38:13.280
I can't accept a favor I haven't earned.

38:15.480 --> 38:17.200
Commander Lin and I

38:17.719 --> 38:19.080
are neither family nor old friends.

38:20.239 --> 38:21.720
I'm afraid of owing him a favor

38:21.800 --> 38:23.160
I may never be able to repay.

38:28.639 --> 38:29.399
Wait here.

38:29.400 --> 38:30.640
I have something for you.

39:06.180 --> 39:10.020
(Fang Yu, Qixia Academy)

39:13.400 --> 39:14.399
This is...

39:14.679 --> 39:16.359
Scholar Shouyi's calling card?

39:18.960 --> 39:21.720
Scholar Shouyi gave it to me by chance.

39:22.039 --> 39:24.799
He said if I ever went to Qixia Academy,

39:24.800 --> 39:26.760
I could take this to him.

39:26.840 --> 39:29.496
But I'm not pursuing an official career
through the examinations,

39:29.528 --> 39:31.430
so this card is of little use to me.

39:32.639 --> 39:34.379
Take it and go see Scholar Shouyi.

39:34.380 --> 39:40.539
♪If you're a lone traveler
returning through the snow♪

39:40.540 --> 39:43.819
(Fang Yu, Qixia Academy)

39:43.820 --> 39:51.460
♪Let me brush the dust
of your journey from your shoulders♪

39:53.740 --> 39:57.500
♪If you're the silent fragrance
of a secluded orchid♪

39:58.400 --> 39:59.559
Scholar Han.

39:59.840 --> 40:01.320
Why aren't you saying anything?

40:04.800 --> 40:07.160
Don't worry about not being
able to repay the favor.

40:07.239 --> 40:10.160
My favor isn't nearly
as great as Young Master Lin's.

40:11.199 --> 40:13.839
I can only get you
a meeting with Scholar Shouyi,

40:13.840 --> 40:16.479
but I can't guarantee
he'll be willing to guide you.

40:17.159 --> 40:18.038
Besides,

40:18.039 --> 40:20.160
you introduced me to Mister Lu.

40:20.199 --> 40:20.919
So

40:20.920 --> 40:22.479
I'll use Scholar Shouyi

40:22.480 --> 40:23.959
to repay that favor.

40:23.960 --> 40:25.240
Now we're even.

40:30.280 --> 40:31.919
I'm just so happy

40:32.719 --> 40:34.240
I don't know what to say.

40:37.320 --> 40:38.678
I'll go check on Mister Lu.

40:38.679 --> 40:40.399
I still haven't memorized
what he taught me

40:40.400 --> 40:41.784
about Playing the Child today.

40:41.832 --> 40:42.740
All right.

40:48.420 --> 41:02.820
♪How could I know spring could be
so beautiful without entering the garden?♪

41:10.280 --> 41:11.399
Mother.

41:11.760 --> 41:12.598
Liang.

41:12.599 --> 41:13.638
Do you want some water too?

41:13.639 --> 41:15.999
I'll pour some for them in a moment,
then I'll get you some.

41:17.400 --> 41:18.399
You...

41:19.400 --> 41:20.198
Liang.

41:20.199 --> 41:21.240
You...

41:23.679 --> 41:25.240
I've fallen for Lanxiang

41:26.280 --> 41:27.640
and want to ask you

41:28.239 --> 41:29.959
to find a matchmaker
and propose marriage.

41:33.280 --> 41:34.800
Silly boy.

41:35.119 --> 41:36.479
We figured out how you felt

41:36.480 --> 41:38.640
a long time ago.

41:42.639 --> 41:43.479
Does

41:43.800 --> 41:45.320
Aunt Xu know, too?

41:46.679 --> 41:48.078
Don't worry.

41:48.079 --> 41:49.800
I know what to do.

41:50.159 --> 41:52.240
We don't have much
to offer as betrothal gifts.

41:52.280 --> 41:54.760
If you pass the examination
before proposing,

41:54.800 --> 41:57.359
wouldn't that bring
Lanxiang greater honor?

42:00.000 --> 42:01.120
Mother.

42:01.880 --> 42:03.959
Lanxiang isn't someone
who cares about such things.

42:05.239 --> 42:06.399
Let's not wait.

42:06.400 --> 42:08.648
Please find a matchmaker
and propose as soon as possible.

42:09.679 --> 42:10.999
I'm afraid if we wait,

42:11.800 --> 42:13.479
someone else will beat me to it.

42:15.199 --> 42:16.238
Who?

42:16.239 --> 42:17.559
Madam Han!

42:18.239 --> 42:19.439
Coming!

42:19.440 --> 42:20.559
Mother.

42:21.840 --> 42:22.919
All right.

42:22.920 --> 42:24.678
I'll do as you say.

42:24.679 --> 42:27.238
Once I've prepared the gifts,
I'll find a matchmaker.

42:27.239 --> 42:28.800
Silly boy.

42:29.920 --> 42:30.959
Coming!

42:51.630 --> 42:54.312
As expected of someone raised
by Dowager Consort Zheng.

42:54.424 --> 42:55.832
(Zheng Manyi, Duke Xianguo's)
Manyi's manners

42:55.840 --> 42:57.270
(Youngest Daughter)
and bearing...

42:57.679 --> 42:59.038
She outshines all the young ladies

42:59.039 --> 43:00.600
in our Lin family.

43:04.780 --> 43:07.660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.159 --> 43:10.800
This orchid is very much to my liking.

43:13.079 --> 43:15.280
I'm willing to pay a high price for it.

43:16.920 --> 43:18.158
I'm very sorry,

43:18.159 --> 43:20.720
but my daughter raised this orchid,

43:20.960 --> 43:22.120
so it isn't for sale.

43:26.880 --> 43:29.600
Could you ask your daughter to come out
so we can discuss it?

43:29.719 --> 43:32.039
Perhaps if she sees how sincere I am,

43:33.079 --> 43:34.640
she'll be willing to part with it.

43:34.880 --> 43:35.999
Well...

43:39.000 --> 43:40.120
Then...

43:40.320 --> 43:41.680
Please wait a moment.

43:42.599 --> 43:43.919
Lanxiang!

43:44.239 --> 43:45.399
Lanxiang!

43:45.519 --> 43:46.999
Come here for a moment.

43:47.119 --> 43:50.600
A customer wants to buy
the orchid you've been raising.

43:51.599 --> 43:52.518
Coming!

43:52.519 --> 43:54.160
I'll just wipe my hands and come over.

44:29.620 --> 44:33.740
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:36.580 --> 44:41.100
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:42.380 --> 44:46.300
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:46.980 --> 44:49.740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:50.460 --> 44:52.780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:52.780 --> 44:55.860
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:57.380 --> 45:01.620
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

45:04.540 --> 45:08.700
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

45:10.500 --> 45:14.060
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

45:14.060 --> 45:17.620
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

45:18.420 --> 45:24.100
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

45:24.460 --> 45:28.780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:29.140 --> 45:32.100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:32.100 --> 45:35.860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:35.860 --> 45:38.740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:38.740 --> 45:42.820
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:42.820 --> 45:46.180
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:46.180 --> 45:49.940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:49.940 --> 45:53.940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:54.700 --> 45:58.860
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:58.860 --> 46:02.300
